body:
AgentService should stop support for the bidi streaming. We no longer want sub agents to be able to trigger other agents through the bidi connection. Proto should look like:

```proto
message AgentRequest {
  string conversation_id = 1;
  string exec_id = 2;
  AgentStart start = 3;
}

message AgentResponse {
  string conversation_id = 1;
  string exec_id = 2;
  oneof type {
    AgentOutputs outputs = 3;
    AgentEnd end = 4;
  }
}

service AgentService {
  rpc Connect(AgentRequest) returns (stream AgentResponse);
}
```

The protocol will be revisited in the long term but we can keep Connect as a placeholder in its new form until we have alignment on agent resumption protocols.

